# --- Runtime vault data (never publish a populated vault) ---
# `lines` and `index.html` ship as an empty starter vault. On a live
# deployment, uncomment the next two lines to keep your ciphertext out of git:
# lines
# index.html
trash
manifest
kdfparams
# Ignore vault backups but keep the directory's access-control guard.
bak/*
!bak/.htaccess

# --- Offline re-encryption tooling working files (ciphertext) ---
moved/

# --- Extension build artifacts & signing keys (NEVER commit) ---
*.pem
*.crx
*.zip
*.xpi
web-ext-artifacts/

# --- Tooling / local ---
node_modules/
.claude/
*.log
.DS_Store
